con ‌privacidad ‌y ‌acceso ‌a ‌servicios ‌clave.","en":"Penthouse ZenMar is a modern duplex penthouse set over two levels in a quiet area of Cabopino. It offers three spacious bedrooms and three modern bathrooms with two ensuite. The property includes a bright open plan kitchen with island and large glass windows that fill the living space with light. There is also an office on the upper floor that can be converted into a fourth bedroom. The solarium level features a private pool and sundeck with panoramic sea views.\n\nThe terraces are generous and designed for outdoor living with both covered and open spaces. A pergola shades the dining area and there is a dedicated BBQ corner surrounded by green areas. The layout creates a calm and private setting while still feeling open and connected to the views. Every space is designed to be practical and easy to enjoy.\n\nThe property is located close to the best beaches in Marbella East and near shops and schools and restaurants. It sits within a gated community with a gym and spa and sauna. ‌Features ‌include ‌underfloor ‌heating ‌throughout ‌and air ‌conditioning and ‌central heating. This is a ‌strong ‌option ‌for ‌buyers ‌seeking a modern home ‌with ‌privacy ‌and ‌access ‌to ‌key ‌amenities."},"features":{"es":["Cerca de Golf","Cerca de Tiendas","Cerca del Mar","Cerca de Ciudad","Cerca de Colegios","Sureste","Excelente","Nueva Construcción","Privada","Aire Acondicionado","Calefacción Central.","Suelo Radiante","Mar","Campo","Panorámicas","Jardín","Piscina","Terraza Cubierta","Armarios Empotrados","Cerca de Transporte","Terraza Privada","Solario","Gimnasio","Sauna","Trastero","Baño En-Suite","Jacuzzi","Barbacoa","Doble acristalamiento","Domotica","Sin Amueblar","Parcialmente Equipada","Cocina Comedor","Comunitario","Recinto Cerrado","Persianas Eléctricas","Más de uno","Privado","Lujo"],"en":["Close To Golf","Close To Shops","Close To Sea","Close To Town","Close To Schools","South East","Excellent","New Construction","Pri